Description: Provides discrete diagnostics for potential taxonomic, temporal,
    spatial and environmental biases in species occurrence data. Assessments can
    be split among user-defined time periods and generally return numerical
    results together with 'ggplot2' visualisations. The original methods and
    package are described by Boyd et al. (2021) <doi:10.1002/ece3.8299>.
